{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Top Drifters is a top-down arcade racer. This means easy to pick up - hard to master, simple controls that let you focus on your racing line.\u00a0 </i> <br> <br><i>It is a physics based racer. Thanks to semi realistic physical forces like torque, gravity and collisions, no two races will ever be the same. </i><br><i> </i><br><i>Race across more than 15 &quot;organic&quot; tracks  featuring unconventional roads, twitchy turns, shortcuts,  jumps, narrow passages, tunnels, and a lot of falling off from high places... </i> <br><i>Each track features different driving surfaces with their unique physics behaviour . Asphalt, dirt, grass, snow and water will affect your car's grip. Will you stay on the road or will you risk taking a shortcut through the slippery grass?\u00a0</i><br><i> </i><br><i>Unlock over 10  cars from different styles and eras, each with distinct driving stats: speed, acceleration, drifting, turbo efficiency, and more. Each car offers a unique driving experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master two types of boost: one that recharges by drifting, and a powerful limited-use &quot;nitro&quot; for when you feel confident (or desperate) enough. </i>  <br> <br>Drift hard, boost harder, and become the ultimate Top Drifter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Top-down arcade racing</strong> with colourful, low-poly visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Drift-focused gameplay</strong> with physics-based handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Two turbo systems</strong>: build boost by drifting or unleash limited-use &quot;supersonic&quot; speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude98 <strong>10+ unique cars</strong>, each with distinct performance traits and driving style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Multiple game modes</strong>: Rally, closed Circuit, Gymkhana, and &quot;Open World&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Wild track traversal</strong>: narrow roads, insane slopes, jumps, tunnels, and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Destructible environments</strong> for that extra hint of chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f <strong>Diverse surfaces</strong>: tarmac, dirt, ice, grass, and water\u2014affecting your car's grip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Single-player campaign</strong> with unlockables and in-game achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Local split-screen multiplayer</strong> for chaotic couch competition</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768050?t=1754297651","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768050/9a091ec4bedb2fe5f0ad340dc88af7b4ef179ead/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754297651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768050/a597155039bcaf1473a5b147656f9bfeb19723f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754297651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768050/a597155039bcaf1473a5b147656f9bfeb19723f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754297651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descripti